# Local-only launcher shims (Hermes-env workaround: strip /opt/hermes from
# PYTHONPATH/sys.path so this project's `cli` package isn't shadowed). Not part
# of the product — real users run the installed `ck-creds` console script. Kept
# out of the repo to avoid leaking the internal /opt/hermes path.
/ck-creds
/ck_creds_entry.py
